{{!
    @template tool_quizbulkedit/preview

    What applying the requested settings would do to each selected quiz: the
    settings that change (current and new value), and the errors that stop a
    quiz from being changed, the warnings and the notes. Nothing has been
    written yet. The stale bar is shown by JS when the settings or the
    selection change after the preview.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="tool_quizbulkedit-preview" - the preview wrapper
    * data-region="tool_quizbulkedit-stale" - the stale-preview bar, inside an always-present live region
    * data-region="tool_quizbulkedit-previewquiz" with data-cmid and data-status - one quiz's preview

    Context variables required for this template:
    * summary string - how many quizzes change, do not change, cannot be changed (plain text)
    * canapply bool - whether any quiz can be changed
    * needsconfirm bool - whether applying resets completion data (a confirmation is required)
    * quizzes array - one entry per selected quiz, in course order
      * cmid int - the course module id
      * name string - the quiz name, already formatted with format_string() (HTML)
      * url string - the quiz's view page
      * status string - change, nochange or error
      * statustext string - the status as text
      * iserror bool - whether the quiz cannot be changed
      * ischange bool - whether the quiz will change
      * hasrows bool - whether there are changed settings to list
      * rows array - the changed settings (plain text)
        * key string - the setting key
        * label string - the setting name
        * old string - the current value
        * new string - the new value
      * errors array - each with message (plain text): why the quiz cannot be changed
      * warnings array - each with message (plain text)
      * notes array - each with message (plain text)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "summary": "2 quizzes will change, 0 will not change, 1 cannot be changed.",
        "canapply": true,
        "needsconfirm": true,
        "quizzes": [
            {
                "cmid": 12,
                "name": "Week 1 quiz",
                "url": "https://example.com/mod/quiz/view.php?id=12",
                "status": "change",
                "statustext": "Will change",
                "iserror": false,
                "ischange": true,
                "hasrows": true,
                "rows": [
                    {"key": "gradepass", "label": "Grade to pass", "old": "0.00", "new": "5.00"},
                    {"key": "completion", "label": "Completion tracking",
                        "old": "Students can manually mark the activity as completed",
                        "new": "Show activity as complete when conditions are met"}
                ],
                "errors": [],
                "warnings": [{"message": "Students have completion data for this quiz."}],
                "notes": []
            },
            {
                "cmid": 13,
                "name": "Week 2 quiz",
                "url": "https://example.com/mod/quiz/view.php?id=13",
                "status": "error",
                "statustext": "Cannot be changed",
                "iserror": true,
                "ischange": false,
                "hasrows": false,
                "rows": [],
                "errors": [{"message": "The grade to pass (12.00) would be higher than the maximum grade (10.00)."}],
                "warnings": [],
                "notes": []
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div data-region="tool_quizbulkedit-preview" class="tool_quizbulkedit-preview">
    <div role="status">
        <div data-region="tool_quizbulkedit-stale" class="alert alert-warning" hidden>{{#str}}previewstale, tool_quizbulkedit{{/str}}</div>
    </div>
    <p class="fw-bold">{{summary}}</p>
    {{#quizzes}}
    <div class="card mb-3" data-region="tool_quizbulkedit-previewquiz" data-cmid="{{cmid}}" data-status="{{status}}">
        <div class="card-header d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center">
            <a class="me-2 fw-bold" href="{{url}}">{{{name}}}</a>
            <span class="badge {{#iserror}}bg-danger{{/iserror}}{{#ischange}}bg-success{{/ischange}}{{^iserror}}{{^ischange}}bg-secondary{{/ischange}}{{/iserror}}">{{statustext}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            {{#errors}}
            <div class="alert alert-danger mb-2">{{message}}</div>
            {{/errors}}
            {{#warnings}}
            <div class="alert alert-warning mb-2">{{message}}</div>
            {{/warnings}}
            {{#notes}}
            <div class="alert alert-info mb-2">{{message}}</div>
            {{/notes}}
            {{#hasrows}}
            <table class="table table-sm generaltable mb-0">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}previewsetting, tool_quizbulkedit{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}previewold, tool_quizbulkedit{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}previewnew, tool_quizbulkedit{{/str}}</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#rows}}
                    <tr data-key="{{key}}">
                        <th scope="row">{{label}}</th>
                        <td>{{old}}</td>
                        <td>{{new}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/rows}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
            {{/hasrows}}
            {{^hasrows}}{{^iserror}}
            <p class="mb-0">{{#str}}previewnochange, tool_quizbulkedit{{/str}}</p>
            {{/iserror}}{{/hasrows}}
        </div>
    </div>
    {{/quizzes}}
    {{#needsconfirm}}
    <div class="alert alert-warning">{{#str}}confirmneeded, tool_quizbulkedit{{/str}}</div>
    {{/needsconfirm}}
    {{^canapply}}
    <div class="alert alert-info">{{#str}}nothingtoapply, tool_quizbulkedit{{/str}}</div>
    {{/canapply}}
</div>
